    <expertiseList>
      <Value>
{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockList":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/f3d69da3dd484108abe177bef1d7d8b5"},{"contentUdi":"umb://element/5fac177adc4a40249c6422e229857587"},{"contentUdi":"umb://element/a5af70fde301463cb8051775e75d4bc7"}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/f3d69da3dd484108abe177bef1d7d8b5","stringItemText":"Concrete Durability Testing"},{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/5fac177adc4a40249c6422e229857587","stringItemText":"Concrete Strength Testing"},{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/a5af70fde301463cb8051775e75d4bc7","stringItemText":"Concrete Mix Designs"}],"settingsData":[]}
</Value>
    </expertiseList>
    <grid>
      <Value>
{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockGrid":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/44774e6d68624231bb87202f63842f3f","areas":[],"columnSpan":12,"rowSpan":1}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"9a4f7c2e-1b3d-4e8a-bf01-7d62a8f5c930","udi":"umb://element/44774e6d68624231bb87202f63842f3f","content":"\u003cdiv class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"758bl\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWith the expansion of Roadlab\u0027s concrete testing capacity in East London, our position as the industry leader in concrete quality assurance in the Eastern Cape is undeniable.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTake a closer look at our new concrete durability department and the concrete tests we offer.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/l01jvbc4/vlcsnap-2020-02-13-16h18m52s927.png\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eDurability Testing\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe are East London\u0027s only provider of quality concrete durability testing.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eD\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eurability testing reveals how well protected your concrete and rebar is from the elements and environmental factors that threaten the long-term integrity of your structures.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur concrete durability testing comprises of three test methods focusing on critical aspects of durability.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOxygen permeability\u003c/strong\u003e, by which we expose concrete samples to pressurised oxygen to test how much oxygen is penetrating into your structures.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWater \u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ILfuVd\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"hgKElc\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003esorptivity\u003c/strong\u003e, by which we measure concrete\u0027s ability to absorb and transmit water and resist exposure to aggressive environments.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eChloride conductivity\u003c/strong\u003e, by which we measure\u003cspan class=\"hgKElc\"\u003e the intrinsic potential of concrete or mortar to resist the ingress of chlorides by diffusion.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/l33naqf4/concrete-durabilities.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eStrength Testing\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur bread and butter, the most common and critical aspects of concrete quality control.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBy exposing concrete cores or hardened samples to compressive and flexural stress, we can determine the strength of the structures that concrete will one day form part of.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur concrete durability testing comprises of three test methods focusing on critical aspects of durability.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompressive strength\u003c/strong\u003e, by means of a concrete cube press.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFlexural strength\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"hgKElc\"\u003e, by means of a concrete beam press. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTensile strength, \u003c/strong\u003eby means of a concrete beam press fitted with a novel tensile test jig.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAggregate Crushing Value\u003c/strong\u003e, by which we determine the particle strength of aggregate for use in concrete.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e10% Fines Aggregate Crushing Test\u003c/strong\u003e, by which we determine \u003cspan class=\"hgKElc\"\u003e the force required to crush a prepared aggregate sample such that 10% of the material passes a specified sieve.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"hgKElc\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/j1hho0e2/vlcsnap-2020-02-13-16h17m29s208.png\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eConcrete Mix Designs\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ILfuVd\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"hgKElc\"\u003eThe perfect marriage of cement, sand and aggregates. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ILfuVd\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"hgKElc\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOur concrete mix designs draw on our decades of experience in every aspect of high-quality mix design, allowing you to mix, pour and build with confidence.  \u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur testing for concrete mix designs focuses on all critical aspects of concrete mixes, including but not limited to the following:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStone\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLoose Bulk Density\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompacted Bulk Density\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAggregate Grading\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBulk Relative Density \u0026gt;5mm\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlakiness Index\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater absorption\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpecific Gravity\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAggregate Crushing Value\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e10% Fines Aggregate Crushing Value\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSand\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOrganic Impurities\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAggregate Grading\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLoose Bulk Density\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompacted Bulk Density\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBulk Density \u0026gt;5mm\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpecific Gravity\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAggregate Crushing Value\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e10% Fines Aggregate Crushing Value\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/vlchwdgr/vlcsnap-2020-02-13-16h37m19s858.png\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eOur dedicated concrete technologists and operations teams in the Eastern Cape are ready to answer your questions. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eReach out to us today.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}],"settingsData":[]}
</Value>
    </grid>
    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[<p>A trusted laboratory offering the Eastern Cape's broadest range of testing services, our accredited facility is equipped to perform all your concrete quality assurance testing.</p>]]></Value>
    </heroContent>
